        "original_id": "8173590c-7a2c-5baf-9d1b-949c8838580e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pat Ashton, Harry Booth, Reg Varney, Doris Hare, Bob Hoskins, John Thaw\n- Products: On the Buses, Mutiny on the Buses, Thick as Thieves\n- Topics: British comedy film, English TV-sitcom film spin-offs, television series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1971, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off On the Buses.\n- In 1971, On the Buses was released as a British comedy film directed by Harry Booth and starring Reg Varney and Doris Hare.\n- In 1972, Pat Ashton appeared in the English TV-sitcom film spin-off Mutiny on the Buses.\n- Pat Ashton was best remembered for her engaging cockney, blonde persona in On the Buses and Mutiny on the Buses.\n- Thick as Thieves was a television series with one series comprising 8 episodes.\n- Thick as Thieves starred Bob Hoskins, John Thaw, and Pat Ashton.",
